#: appinstaller.rs:119
msgid "This file is not an app that can be installed here (.deb, .flatpak, .flatpakref or AppImage)."
msgstr "Šis fails nav lietotne, ko var instalēt šeit (.deb, .flatpak, .flatpakref vai AppImage)."

